    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GPT-5.6 Sol on wolfram2002-ch01-03: partially-resolvable, resolvability 0.22";
    dc:description "Restricted case studies are possible, but existing observations do not identify whether nature operates like typical programs. The broad explanatory and exclusionary wording has weak discrimination from many rival mechanisms.";
