    dc:type "resolution-route/mixed";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: For selected natural phenomena, fit specified simple-program generative models and rival mechanistic models to observations, then compare predictive likelihood and complexity. Better program-model predictions would support a restricted version, while systematic failure would refute it in those domains.";
